!     e IS AN INPUT/OUTPUT VARIABLE. IF e .GE. 0 THEN IT IS ASSUMED
!     THAT e = exp(x). IN THIS CASE e IS NOT MODIFIED. IF e .LT. 0
!     then e is set to exp(x) when this value is needed.
